OL,5,G0105 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,6,     FIn the 100th episode, Graeme
OL,7,     Ftackles a canine master food thief
OL,8,     Fwho's pillaging picnics. And an
OL,9,     Fowner's every move is met with an
OL,10,     Fonslaught of barky abuse and nasty
OL,11,     Fnips.
OL,12,G0210 Dogs Behaving (Very) Badly
OL,13,     FA pair of hounds cause mayhem at
OL,14,     Ftheir owners' antiques shop. Can
OL,15,     FGraeme Hall teach them how to give
OL,16,     Fshoppers a warm welcome? And it's
OL,17,     Fthe toughest lesson yet at puppy
OL,18,     Fschool - recall.
